    "guide": "Uses A2A v1.0.1 JSON-RPC. HTTP(S) URLs must not contain user information or fragments. authentication references existing credential IDs; never embed secrets. Attachments select visible state paths, at most 10 files and 20 MiB total; binary content stays outside state. timeoutSeconds: 1–600, default 120. Timeout does not prove absence of remote side effects: use native task inspection, cancellation and recovery rather than blindly retrying.",
