    "guide": "true and false are independent conditions, evaluated in that order; if neither matches, execution ends. Supported syntax is a field path tested for truthiness, or compared to one literal with == != >= <= > <. No Python/JavaScript, and/or, calls or arbitrary expressions. Use sourceHandle true/false, with at most one edge per handle; an unconnected result ends. This node records routing and trace, not a business boolean output. Agent/App/CodeAct nodes must create business outputs and publish them with globalKeys.",
