    "guide": "Evaluate cases in order and select the first match; otherwise use default. Case IDs must be nonempty and unique. sourceHandle is case:<id> or default, with at most one edge per handle. defaultCase.condition is descriptive only. Conditions use the same limited syntax as if_else. Connect the default branch explicitly.",
